== Trivia ==
* III - The Empress? will display a pop up saying "''The morning sun has vanquished the horrible night''", a reference to ''[[wikipedia:Castlevania II: Simon's Quest|Castlevania II: Simon's Quest]]'' when night turns to day.
** This is also a reference to {{i|Whore of Babylon}}'s (and by extension {{p|III - The Empress}}') pop up being the day to night message in said game.

